{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04WT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$U$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{C}/U$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0006": "$U$", "MATH_0007": "$h_U$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:021c5628d76dde66b66dd4d8b9e7f4ba8f37e034b066b5142a9196bc67ea8059", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9e7890e257f951a65750dc040e9038175bca2da0ea2fcbe12561bd4e47b85d04", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a site.\nLet <MATH_0002> be an object of <MATH_0003>.\nWe want to understand stacks over <MATH_0004> as stacks\nover <MATH_0005> together with a morphism towards <MATH_0006>.\nThe following lemma is the reason why this is easier to do\nwhen the presheaf <MATH_0007> is a sheaf.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:96ff7a7ea5bebf06bb636c96e9652a105abdfa3e889acab468f6218b3df5cf70", "unit_id": "tag:04WT:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "stacks", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04WT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$U \\in \\Ob(\\mathcal{C})$", "MATH_0003": "$j_U : \\mathcal{C}/U \\to \\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0005": "$h_U$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-when-localization-stack}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:dacbdbccee290b34a48d4078a8ae757271a1b2e7bbd05fabea0c283f8cb9b853", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3a8ac0c93a037b7c572c0d59a084c668d678e0c0c94dc963c9793317c044ac31", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a site. Let <MATH_0002>.\nThen <MATH_0003> is a stack over <MATH_0004>\nif and only if <MATH_0005> is a sheaf.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e42d6a6fa656b596bec6ac5848a57428b57a4af191c06da23fbff914b85ba946", "unit_id": "tag:04WU:statement"}
